sequenceDiagram
    participant Admin as Gate Admin
    participant Gate as eFTI Gate (eu-xx01)
    participant PlatformReg as PlatformRegistry
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over Admin: Admin has the platform's<br/>eDelivery AP X.509 cert<br/>(MS-issued per Reg<br/>2024/1942 Art 11).<br/>Ready to register.

    Admin->>+Gate: POST /api/v1/platforms<br/>Authorization: Bearer TARA-JWT
    Note over Admin,Gate: Body — PlatformWrite:<br/>id, baseUrl,<br/>eDeliveryCert.<br/>Full schema: openapi.yaml.

    Gate->>Gate: Validate JWT (signature, exp, iss, aud, not in denylist),<br/>resolve users row

    Gate->>+PlatformReg: save(PlatformWrite)
    PlatformReg->>+DB: Append a new platforms row carrying the platform's id, baseUrl,<br/>eDeliveryCert, status='ONLINE',<br/>created_by=admin's user-row-id.
    Note over DB: Append-only — every<br/>save is a new row.<br/>Latest row by created_at<br/>wins.
    DB-->>-PlatformReg: written
    PlatformReg-->>-Gate: saved

    Gate-->>-Admin: 201 Created<br/>{ "id":"plt-xxx-001", "baseUrl":"https://efti.example.com",<br/>  "status":"ONLINE", "createdAt":"2026-04-22T10:15:30Z" }

    Note over Admin,Gate: Platform auths via mTLS —<br/>the cert is the credential.<br/>No user, no secret issued.<br/>Identity = eDelivery cert.<br/>--<br/>Cert renewal: PUT with<br/>new eDeliveryCert —<br/>append-only INSERT, old<br/>cert stops resolving once<br/>the new row is latest.
